# TN Agents Policy

## portfolio.deepvest.calculated

### instruction
Use the governed portfolio inputs only to create the approved portfolio analysis and report row.

### use_for
Internal portfolio analysis and reporting for the authorized DeepVest workflow.

### do_not_use_for
Trade execution, investment order placement, or external redistribution of account-level data.

### consequences
Unauthorized use can expose confidential account information and violate portfolio-data governance.

### on_violation_or_error
log_and_continue
